67c72f8216fd4b2af7cc5012f6d","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":35},{"dia_id":"D28:36","global_turn_index":519,"locator":"[S28T36]","raw_turn_sha256":"fdfcb599a61f9005e6eb94e7b8613cae84008cbacd01bd9d1ddc4bc5938a266f","rendered_turn_sha256":"43ea32b39a2252d10fe43992e51dbe32248dd377d1767a4ef5a8de728bad2613","session_date":"2023-11-02","session_datetime":"2023-11-02T17:46:00","session_id":"session_28","session_index":28,"source_sha256":"8f1ebc87ca8b82783562338a2d13c63c67cc93d23100b18f826910e050112596","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":36}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Yup, it's that connection I'm aiming for with my music. Take a loot at my studio setup, that's look awesome, isn't it?\n[Image caption: a photography of a recording studio with a monitor, keyboard, and monitor]\n[S28T27] (dia_id: D28:27)\n\nDave: Wow, your studio looks stunning! How do you like hanging out here? Do you watch much TV?\n[S28T28] (dia_id: D28:28)\n\nCalvin: I only work in the studio. I have another room for relaxation with a TV, just take a look that room is cozy and relaxing. And yeah, It's a great way to unwind and get inspired.\n[Image caption: a photo of a living room with a couch, chair, television and a table]\n[S28T29] (dia_id: D28:29)\n\nDave: Wow, nice setup! What do you usually watch on it?\n[S28T30] (dia_id: D28:30)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I usually watch music videos, concerts, and documentaries about artists and their creative process. It's cool to learn more about the industry and see what others do. Plus, it's a source of inspiration for me.\n[S28T31] (dia_id: D28:31)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, that's awesome! Keep up the great work! Take a look at the photo!\n[Image caption: a photo of a notebook with a pen and a notepad on it]\n[S28T32] (dia_id: D28:32)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Appreciate the support! Does this notebook help you stay connected to the creative process?\n[S28T33] (dia_id: D28:33)\n\nDave: Yes, Calvin, writing lyrics and notes - that's awesome! It will boost my motivation! Writing lyrics boosts my motivation to grow!\n[Image caption: a photo of a pink floyd headphone sitting on a shelf]\n[S28T34] (dia_id: D28:34)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! These really help you stay focused when making music.\n[S28T35] (dia_id: D28:35)\n\nDave: Cool, Calvin! Music really helps me focus and be productive. When I'm doing my car stuff, I listen to vinyl to relax and stay on track.\n[S28T36] (dia_id: D28:36)","text_sha256":"5aab51283a134def3abd73d8ad376256fc5ab5edcc5d8a0467637f021f54e7e9","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D29:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":39,"line_start":38,"source_locators":["[S29T9]"],"text_sha256":"9f6b6b2db271659ebdce5f892b5aba80984832fbb307b889cd0395ddc5fdbb66"},{"dia_ids":["D29:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":42,"line_start":41,"source_locators":["[S29T10]"],"text_sha256":"b8a1c3cc83b5f90e3cd42177072239c443cea85e40570db657afe2563cf56335"},{"dia_ids":["D29:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":45,"line_start":44,"source_locators":["[S29T11]"],"text_sha256":"062c94139fd802ca210405b114e2cc3e774faac5ba9380ae71d015495187914f"},{"dia_ids":["D29:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":48,"line_start":47,"source_locators":["[S29T12]"],"text_sha256":"b47deae7110b02a4d693d1da323a13342e76307af25ede8841eecb26e40abcf0"},{"dia_ids":["D29:13"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":52,"line_start":50,"source_locators":["[S29T13]"],"text_sha256":"527e9ed03aca64039ddb76c197b5c4bb6b5c141605beacff2e58418a91b34568"},{"dia_ids":["D29:14"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":55,"line_start":54,"source_locators":["[S29T14]"],"text_sha256":"3703476815afc34bf3168ce299d4cce80fb4df445ca57ab47bcac0279202f9ed"},{"dia_ids":["D29:15"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":58,"line_start":57,"source_locators":["[S29T15]"],"text_sha256":"e39f59437c38949084b696cfd